  "body": "If the popovertarget attribute and the popovertargetaction attribute of the button element and the input element are currently not used much by HTML authors, shouldn't they move to \"16 Obsolete features\"?\nBecause functionality of the popovertarget attribute and the popovertargetaction attribute overlaps with the command attribute and the commandfor attribute of the button element.\n",
